<mxCell id="legend" value="Solid arrows: calls (the View calls ViewModel methods; repositories call the backend). Dashed open arrows: the View observes a ViewModel StateFlow, reading state with no call. Dashed arrows with two heads: Cloud Functions triggered by Firestore and Storage writes. Double-headed solid arrows: reads/writes plus realtime listeners and offline cache. Role is stored as a field in the user document, set once at sign-up; Firestore and Storage security rules enforce role access and block later role edits. Firestore queues writes offline by itself; the offline worker (WorkManager) queues photo uploads." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="990" width="960" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
